Workers	100k/يوم	$0.30/M
B2 Storage	10GB	$0.005/GB
B2 Downloads	1GB/يوم	مجاناً عبر Cloudflare Bandwidth Alliance
B2 Operations	2,500 Class C/يوم	$0.004/10k عمليات
